---
description: Never attribute git commits or PRs to AI tools
alwaysApply: true
---

# No AI git attribution

Never add any of these to commit messages, PR bodies, or code comments:
- `Co-authored-by: Cursor`
- `Co-authored-by: Claude` / Anthropic / v0 / Copilot / ChatGPT / Codex
- `Made-with: Cursor` / `Made with Cursor`
- `--trailer` flags that credit AI tools

Commits must be authored only as the human repo owner (`git config user.name` / `user.email`).
If the environment injects an AI trailer anyway, strip it before push (amend only when the commit is still local / unpushed).
